{
  "name": "Mortar · Hourly weather → /directory/sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "7fe444bf-90bf-472c-a72d-0db7e2f6b64a",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hourly weather → Mortar\nThe emergency SOP makes no heat P1 at or below 40°F and no AC P1 at or above 95°F. Mortar applies that by rule; this workflow keeps the outside temperature fresh (Mortar ignores readings older than 3 hours, so a broken feed can never set severity).\n\nSource: National Weather Service, station KAUS (Austin-Bergstrom). No API key; NWS asks for a descriptive User-Agent.\n\nEvery request to Mortar is signed: the Code node builds the exact JSON string, the Crypto node signs that string (HMAC-SHA256, MORTAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET), and the HTTP node sends the same string as the raw body with `X-Mortar-Signature: sha256=<hex>`. Mortar rejects anything else with 401 and dedupes redeliveries by id.\n\nNeeds n8n env vars: `MORTAR_URL`, `MORTAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET` (and `N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=false`).",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "794cd64a-8101-4c04-adf9-bd603c087bf1",
      "name": "Every hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5bab90c5-b0d5-467f-a9f1-dc556e480e20",
      "name": "NWS latest observation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.weather.gov/stations/KAUS/observations/latest",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "User-Agent",
              "value": "mortar-ops (ops@northwind.example)"
            },
            {
              "name": "Accept",
              "value": "application/geo+json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "96964b0c-b5e1-45d0-a7d5-07a14bceaec5",
      "name": "Build weather update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// NWS reports °C and may return null while a sensor is down — then send nothing.\nconst out = [];\nfor (const { json } of $input.all()) {\n  const celsius = json.properties?.temperature?.value;\n  if (typeof celsius !== 'number') continue;\n  const station = String(json.properties.station ?? '').split('/').pop();\n  const payload = { weather: { tempF: Math.round((celsius * 9) / 5 + 32), observedAt: json.properties.timestamp, source: `NWS ${station}`.trim() } };\n  out.push({ json: { payload: JSON.stringify(payload) } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "83ad18d8-aa00-4334-ad94-379ae2608610",
      "name": "Sign (HMAC-SHA256)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hmac",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "value": "={{ $json.payload }}",
        "dataPropertyName": "signature",
        "secret": "={{ $env.MORTAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET }}",
        "encoding": "hex"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cbdf965f-fcf3-472d-a7df-6140f0d6f9d8",
      "name": "POST /directory/sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.MORTAR_URL }}/directory/sync",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Mortar-Signature",
              "value": "=sha256={{ $json.signature }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "rawContentType": "application/json",
        "body": "={{ $json.payload }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every hour": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "NWS latest observation",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "NWS latest observation": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build weather update",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build weather update": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Sign (HMAC-SHA256)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Sign (HMAC-SHA256)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST /directory/sync",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/Chicago",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "description": "Latest NWS observation for Austin, so 'no heat' at ≤ 40°F and 'no AC' at ≥ 95°F are P1 by rule."
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "mortar"
    }
  ]
}
